#: sinclaire_sink/Sinclaire_Transforms2/0/g-1/22
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "What is your name?"
msgstr ""

#: sinclaire_sink/Sinclaire_Transforms2/0/g-1/33
msgctxt "Sinclaire"
msgid "I'm... I'm Sinclaire, of course."
msgstr ""

#: sinclaire_sink/Sinclaire_Transforms2/0/g-1/44
msgctxt "Sudsy"
msgid "ROF rofrofrofrofrof mmmmmmm ROF ROF ROF!!!!!"
msgstr ""

#: sinclaire_sink/Sinclaire_Transforms2/0/g-1/52
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "We've done it!"
msgstr ""

#: sinclaire_sink/Sinclaire_Transforms2/0/g-1/70
msgctxt "Sinclaire"
msgid "Done what, Maggie?"
msgstr ""

#: sinclaire_sink/Sinclaire_Transforms2/0/g-1/78
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Never you mind, Sinclaire. Never you mind."
msgstr ""

#: sinclaire_sink/Sinclaire_Transforms2/0/g-1/86/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I think you'd better get some rest, Sinclaire."
msgstr ""

#: sinclaire_sink/Sinclaire_Transforms2/0/g-1/87/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Maggie, why don't I wrap things up here?"
msgstr ""

#: sinclaire_sink/Sinclaire_Transforms2/0/g-1/c-6/7
msgctxt "Sinclaire"
msgid "Yes... That would be nice. I am quite tired."
msgstr ""

#: sinclaire_sink/Sinclaire_Transforms2/0/g-1/c-6/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'll come see you soon."
msgstr ""

#: sinclaire_sink/Sinclaire_Transforms2/0/g-1/c-6/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Shall we?"
msgstr ""

#: sinclaire_sink/Sinclaire_Transforms2/0/g-1/c-6/15/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Indeed."
msgstr ""

#: sinclaire_sink/Sinclaire_Transforms2/0/g-1/c-6/15/c-0/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You go ahead, Maggie. I'll catch up."
msgstr ""

#: sinclaire_sink/Sinclaire_Transforms2/0/g-1/c-6/15/c-0/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Meet me back at my office."
msgstr ""

#: sinclaire_sink/Sinclaire_Transforms2/0/g-1/c-6/15/c-0/15/c-1/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Don't take too long..."
msgstr ""

#: sinclaire_sink/Sinclaire_Transforms2/0/g-1/c-7/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Of course. You know where to find me..."
msgstr ""

#: sinclaire_sink/Sinclaire_Transforms2/0/g-1/c-7/15/b/1
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Detective."
msgstr ""

#: sinclaire_sink/WeDontKnow/0/0
msgctxt "Sinclaire"
msgid "So, all this questioning was for naught?"
msgstr ""

#: sinclaire_sink/WeDontKnow/0/8
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "I'm sorry."
msgstr ""

#: sinclaire_sink/WeDontKnow/0/16
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "We only announce the results of investigations when we are 100% confident."
msgstr ""

#: sinclaire_sink/WeDontKnow/0/24
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "In your case, we just couldn't be certain."
msgstr ""

#: sinclaire_sink/WeDontKnow/0/32
msgctxt "Sinclaire"
msgid "What am I to make of my situation?"
msgstr ""

#: sinclaire_sink/WeDontKnow/0/40
msgctxt "Sinclaire"
msgid "Neither man nor sink, am I doomed to reside in this middle-world forever?"
msgstr ""

#: sinclaire_sink/WeDontKnow/0/48/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm sorry Sinclaire, I'm afraid so."
msgstr ""

#: sinclaire_sink/WeDontKnow/0/49/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'll keep trying to figure this out."
msgstr ""

#: sinclaire_sink/WeDontKnow/0/50/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Maybe it's ok to be a sink?"
msgstr ""

#: sinclaire_sink/WeDontKnow/0/51/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Maybe the curse will wear off some day."
msgstr ""

#: sinclaire_sink/WeDontKnow/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Sinclaire"
msgid "I'm a monster! A freak!"
msgstr ""

#: sinclaire_sink/WeDontKnow/0/c-0/18/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You're not a monster. You're just... different."
msgstr ""

#: sinclaire_sink/WeDontKnow/0/c-0/18/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I have to admit, you are pretty weird."
msgstr ""

#: sinclaire_sink/WeDontKnow/0/c-0/18/c-0/7
msgctxt "Sinclaire"
msgid "Different like a fox!"
msgstr ""

#: sinclaire_sink/WeDontKnow/0/c-0/18/c-1/7
msgctxt "Sinclaire"
msgid "Thank you!"
msgstr ""

#: sinclaire_sink/WeDontKnow/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Sinclaire"
msgid "Don't bother. I've given up hope."
msgstr ""

#: sinclaire_sink/WeDontKnow/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Sinclaire"
msgid "Easy for you to say. You get to be a trapezoid."
msgstr ""

#: sinclaire_sink/WeDontKnow/0/c-2/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "A... trapezoid?"
msgstr ""

#: sinclaire_sink/WeDontKnow/0/c-2/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Sinclaire"
msgid "With all your uneven, beautiful angles."
msgstr ""

#: sinclaire_sink/WeDontKnow/0/c-2/15/c-0/18/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I just... ok."
msgstr ""

#: sinclaire_sink/WeDontKnow/0/c-2/15/c-0/18/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Why yes, I'm glad you noticed."
msgstr ""

#: sinclaire_sink/WeDontKnow/0/c-2/15/c-0/18/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm a human."
msgstr ""

#: sinclaire_sink/WeDontKnow/0/c-2/15/c-0/18/c-1/7
msgctxt "Sinclaire"
msgid "I'm very perceptive."
msgstr ""

#: sinclaire_sink/WeDontKnow/0/c-2/15/c-0/18/c-2/7
msgctxt "Sinclaire"
msgid "Suuuure you are. And I'm a sink."
msgstr ""

#: sinclaire_sink/WeDontKnow/0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Sinclaire"
msgid "And maybe it'll deepen to the point I'm a talking toilet. God forbid!"
msgstr ""

#: sinclaire_sink/WeDontKnow/0/c-3/18/b/1
msgctxt "Jean Loo"
msgid "Meh."
msgstr ""

#: sinclaire_sink/WeDontKnow/0/c-3/18/b/15
msgctxt "Sinclaire"
msgid "And now I'm hearing voices!"
msgstr ""

#: sinclaire_sink/WeDontKnow/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Sinclaire"
msgid "Well, annnyyyyway. I guess I'll just be here, washing things."
msgstr ""

#: sinclaire_sink/WeDontKnow/0/g-0/11
msgctxt "Sinclaire"
msgid "And pining away for my long-lost home in Turkelman City."
msgstr ""

#: sinclaire_sink/WeDontKnow/0/g-0/19
msgctxt "Sinclaire"
msgid "Feel free to come by and see me whenever you like."
msgstr ""

#: sinclaire_sink/WeDontKnow/0/g-0/27
msgctxt "Sinclaire"
msgid "And thank you for trying to help me."
msgstr ""

#: sinclaire_sink/WeDontKnow/0/g-0/35
msgctxt "Sinclaire"
msgid "I'll always think of you as a friend."
msgstr ""

#: sinclaire_sink/ASinkOnceMore/0/3
msgctxt "Sinclaire"
msgid "I feel as if we are meeting for the first time."
msgstr ""

#: sinclaire_sink/ASinkOnceMore/0/11/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Me too."
msgstr ""

#: sinclaire_sink/ASinkOnceMore/0/12/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Well, hello Sinclaire. It's a pleasure."
msgstr ""

#: sinclaire_sink/ASinkOnceMore/0/13/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You were pretty messed up there for a minute."
msgstr ""

#: sinclaire_sink/ASinkOnceMore/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Sinclaire"
msgid "I assure you, the pleasure is all mine."
msgstr ""

#: sinclaire_sink/ASinkOnceMore/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Sinclaire"
msgid "It was a very strange time..."
msgstr ""

#: sinclaire_sink/ASinkOnceMore/0/c-2/15
msgctxt "Sinclaire"
msgid "But you saved me."
msgstr ""

#: sinclaire_sink/ASinkOnceMore/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Sinclaire"
msgid "If it weren't for you, I'd still be a raving lunatic."
msgstr ""

#: sinclaire_sink/ASinkOnceMore/0/g-0/11
msgctxt "Sinclaire"
msgid "Now that I'm back to my old self, I'd love to thank you properly."
msgstr ""

#: sinclaire_sink/ASinkOnceMore/0/g-0/19/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I wouldn't say no to a date..."
msgstr ""

#: sinclaire_sink/ASinkOnceMore/0/g-0/20/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Maybe we can just hang out?"
msgstr ""

#: sinclaire_sink/ASinkOnceMore/0/g-0/c-3/22
msgctxt "Sinclaire"
msgid "And neither would I."
msgstr ""

#: sinclaire_sink/ASinkOnceMore/0/g-0/c-3/30
msgctxt "Sinclaire"
msgid "May I take your hand?"
msgstr ""

#: sinclaire_sink/ASinkOnceMore/0/g-0/c-3/38/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Please do..."
msgstr ""

#: sinclaire_sink/ASinkOnceMore/0/g-0/c-3/38/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You can take more than my hand."
msgstr ""

#: sinclaire_sink/ASinkOnceMore/0/g-0/c-3/38/c-0/7
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Sinclaire reaches out for your hand, taking it in his with a pronounced tenderness. He brushes his thumb gently across the back of it."
msgstr ""

#: sinclaire_sink/ASinkOnceMore/0/g-0/c-3/38/c-0/15
msgctxt "Sinclaire"
msgid "So soft... I could caress you all day."
msgstr ""

#: sinclaire_sink/ASinkOnceMore/0/g-0/c-3/38/c-0/29/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Sinclaire, you're so gentle."
msgstr ""

#: sinclaire_sink/ASinkOnceMore/0/g-0/c-3/38/c-0/29/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "And all night, if you like..."
msgstr ""

#: sinclaire_sink/ASinkOnceMore/0/g-0/c-3/38/c-0/29/c-0/7
msgctxt "Sinclaire"
msgid "I can also be firm."
msgstr ""

#: sinclaire_sink/ASinkOnceMore/0/g-0/c-3/38/c-0/29/c-0/15
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "He can indeed."
msgstr ""

#: sinclaire_sink/ASinkOnceMore/0/g-0/c-3/38/c-0/29/c-1/7
msgctxt "Sinclaire"
msgid "I would like that very much..."
msgstr ""

#: sinclaire_sink/ASinkOnceMore/0/g-0/c-3/38/c-0/29/c-1/18
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Your night becomes full of porcelain and neckties."
msgstr ""

#: sinclaire_sink/ASinkOnceMore/0/g-0/c-3/38/c-1/7
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Sinclaire fans at himself with one hand, tugging at his tie-pipes."
msgstr ""

#: sinclaire_sink/ASinkOnceMore/0/g-0/c-3/38/c-1/18
msgctxt "Sinclaire"
msgid "My, my. Let's at least wait until after dinner..."
msgstr ""

#: sinclaire_sink/ASinkOnceMore/0/g-0/c-3/38/c-1/26
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "With fierce abandon, you show him that waiting is not an option. He is soon... drained."
msgstr ""

#: sinclaire_sink/ASinkOnceMore/0/g-0/c-4/7
msgctxt "Sinclaire"
msgid "That would be marvelous!"
msgstr ""

#: sinclaire_sink/ASinkOnceMore/0/g-0/c-4/18/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "And... maybe we can bring the dog?"
msgstr ""

#: sinclaire_sink/ASinkOnceMore/0/g-0/c-4/18/c-0/7
msgctxt "Sinclaire"
msgid "Always."
msgstr ""

#: sinclaire_sink/ASinkOnceMore/0/g-0/c-4/18/c-0/15
msgctxt "Sinclaire"
msgid "Come along, Sudsy!"
msgstr ""

#: sinclaire_sink/ASinkOnceMore/0/g-0/c-4/18/c-0/26
msgctxt "Sudsy"
msgid "... bwuff!"
msgstr ""

#: sinclaire_sink/ASinkOnceMore/0/g-0/c-4/18/c-0/37/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Good boy!"
msgstr ""

#: sinclaire_sink/ASinkOnceMore/0/g-0/c-4/18/c-0/37/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Great boy!"
msgstr ""

#: sinclaire_sink/ASinkOnceMore/0/g-0/c-4/18/c-0/37/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Excellent boy!"
msgstr ""

#: sinclaire_sink/ASinkOnceMore/0/g-0/c-4/18/c-0/37/3/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Best of all possible boys!"
msgstr ""

#. Morceau de phrase coupé par une variable (nom du joueur, nombre...).
#: sinclaire_sink/sinclaire_love_return/0/0
msgctxt "Sinclaire"
msgid "Why, if it isn’t my darling"
msgstr ""

#. Morceau de phrase coupé par une variable (nom du joueur, nombre...).
#: sinclaire_sink/sinclaire_love_return/0/5
msgctxt "Narration / joueur"
msgid "! What an outpouring of joy it brings me to see you again!"
msgstr ""

#: sinclaire_sink/sinclaire_love_return/0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I always love seeing you Sinclaire."
msgstr ""

#: sinclaire_sink/sinclaire_love_return/0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Actually, I’m ready to Realize you."
msgstr ""

#: sinclaire_sink/sinclaire_love_return/0/18/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Perhaps Winnifred will send us a little hot water…"
msgstr ""

#: sinclaire_sink/sinclaire_love_return/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Sinclaire"
msgid "Shall we leave the tap open and while away the hours in delightful conversation?"
msgstr ""

#: sinclaire_sink/sinclaire_love_return/0/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yes, let’s let it flow!"
msgstr ""

#: sinclaire_sink/sinclaire_love_return/0/c-0/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Sinclaire"
msgid "Then flow it shall!"
msgstr ""

#: sinclaire_sink/sinclaire_love_return/0/c-0/15/c-0/15
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "The hours pass by so quickly when you are with your lover Sinclaire the Sink."
msgstr ""

#: sinclaire_sink/sinclaire_love_return/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Sinclaire"
msgid "You’ve read my mind…"
msgstr ""

#: sinclaire_sink/sinclaire_love_return/0/c-2/18
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Things heat up between you and your lover Sinclaire, but always within responsible temperature limits."
msgstr ""

#: sinclaire_sink/sinclaire_martin_love_return/0/0
msgctxt "Sinclaire"
msgid "My dearest. I love thee almost as much as the streets of my home."
msgstr ""

#: sinclaire_sink/sinclaire_martin_love_return/0/8
msgctxt "Sinclaire"
msgid "Didst thou come to make love?"
msgstr ""

#: sinclaire_sink/sinclaire_martin_love_return/0/16
msgctxt "Sinclaire"
msgid "Or to have a claim adjusted?"
msgstr ""

#: sinclaire_sink/sinclaire_martin_love_return/0/24
msgctxt "Sinclaire"
msgid "Or to ogle at my hideous form?"
msgstr ""

#: sinclaire_sink/sinclaire_martin_love_return/0/32/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Martin, you're a wet, porcelain angel."
msgstr ""

#: sinclaire_sink/sinclaire_martin_love_return/0/33/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh, Sinky, I came to make love!"
msgstr ""

#: sinclaire_sink/sinclaire_martin_love_return/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Sinclaire"
msgid "Hopefully not for long."
msgstr ""

#: sinclaire_sink/sinclaire_martin_love_return/0/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Exactly! I've come to Realize you!"
msgstr ""

#: sinclaire_sink/sinclaire_martin_love_return/0/c-0/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Well, for a bit longer..."
msgstr ""

#: sinclaire_sink/sinclaire_martin_love_return/0/c-0/15/c-1/7
msgctxt "Sinclaire"
msgid "Come see me any time."
msgstr ""

#: sinclaire_sink/sinclaire_martin_love_return/0/c-0/15/c-1/15
msgctxt "Sinclaire"
msgid "You do help the time flow by."
msgstr ""

#: sinclaire_sink/sinclaire_martin_love_return/0/c-0/15/c-1/23
msgctxt "Sinclaire"
msgid "Damn it. I mean 'go' by."
msgstr ""

#: sinclaire_sink/sinclaire_martin_love_return/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Sinclaire"
msgid "Sinky?"
msgstr ""

#: sinclaire_sink/sinclaire_martin_love_return/0/c-1/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I meant Martin."
msgstr ""

#: sinclaire_sink/sinclaire_martin_love_return/0/c-1/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It's my new nickname for you."
msgstr ""

#: sinclaire_sink/sinclaire_martin_love_return/0/c-1/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Sinclaire"
msgid "Ah, yes. I thought you did."
msgstr ""

#: sinclaire_sink/sinclaire_martin_love_return/0/c-1/15/c-1/7
msgctxt "Sinclaire"
msgid "How spicy!"
msgstr ""

#: sinclaire_sink/sinclaire_martin_love_return/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Sinclaire"
msgid "Let's get down to business!"
msgstr ""

#: sinclaire_sink/sinclaire_martin_love_return/0/g-0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Are you... gonna kiss me or something?"
msgstr ""

#: sinclaire_sink/sinclaire_martin_love_return/0/g-0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "So... Lovemaking?"
msgstr ""

#: sinclaire_sink/sinclaire_martin_love_return/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Sinclaire"
msgid "Oh no, not lovemaking. Business! Let me adjust whatever claims you've brought me."
msgstr ""

#: sinclaire_sink/sinclaire_martin_love_return/0/g-1/11/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'll... just go."
msgstr ""

#: sinclaire_sink/sinclaire_martin_love_return/0/g-1/12/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Right. Lovemaking next time maybe..."
msgstr ""

#: sinclaire_sink/sinclaire_love_realize_begin/0/12
msgctxt "Sinclaire"
msgid "Realize me?! Why... I never thought I would have that luxury!"
msgstr ""

#: sinclaire_sink/sinclaire_love_realize_begin/0/20
msgctxt "Sinclaire"
msgid "Have you washed away all that stands in the way of this?"
msgstr ""

#: sinclaire_sink/sinclaire_love_realize_begin/0/37/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I have! Let’s do it!"
msgstr ""

#: sinclaire_sink/sinclaire_love_realize_begin/0/38/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Actually… I need a little more time."
msgstr ""

#: sinclaire_sink/sinclaire_love_realize_begin/0/c-0/13
msgctxt "Sinclaire"
msgid "Well, lathe my hands and call me Martin!"
msgstr ""

#: sinclaire_sink/sinclaire_love_realize_begin/0/c-0/21
msgctxt "Sinclaire"
msgid "Well.. please don't. I've already been confused enough"
msgstr ""

#: sinclaire_sink/sinclaire_love_realize_begin/0/c-1/10
msgctxt "Sinclaire"
msgid "Of course. Return when you’re ready. Sudsy and I will be here."
msgstr ""

#: sinclaire_sink/sinclaire_love_realize_return/0/0
msgctxt "Sinclaire"
msgid "Ah! Back again? Ready to show me my new form?"
msgstr ""

#: sinclaire_sink/sinclaire_love_realize_return/0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You bet!"
msgstr ""

#: sinclaire_sink/sinclaire_love_realize_return/0/18/s/0 sinclaire_sink/sinclaire_martin_love_realize_begin/0/30/s/0 sinclaire_sink/sinclaire_martin_love_realize_return/0/18/s/0 sinclaire_sink/sinclaire_realize_join/0/48/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I don't think that will be enough..."
msgstr ""

#: sinclaire_sink/sinclaire_love_realize_return/0/c-1/10
msgctxt "Sinclaire"
msgid "Not a problem, dear one. Come on back when ready."
msgstr ""

#: sinclaire_sink/sinclaire_martin_love_realize_begin/0/12
msgctxt "Sinclaire"
msgid "My savior! Is it time?"
msgstr ""

#: sinclaire_sink/sinclaire_martin_love_realize_begin/0/29/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It is! Everything is ready!"
msgstr ""

#: sinclaire_sink/sinclaire_martin_love_realize_begin/0/c-1/10
msgctxt "Sinclaire"
msgid "Alas, I shall wait here, dreaming of claims left unadjusted."
msgstr ""

#: sinclaire_sink/sinclaire_martin_love_realize_return/0/0
msgctxt "Sinclaire"
msgid "Are we ready? To bring me back to my true form?"
msgstr ""

#: sinclaire_sink/sinclaire_martin_love_realize_return/0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yes! We are!"
msgstr ""

#: sinclaire_sink/sinclaire_martin_love_realize_return/0/c-1/10
msgctxt "Sinclaire"
msgid "I shall endure until you have what is needed."
msgstr ""

#: sinclaire_sink/Martin_Stays_Martin/0/3
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Sinclaire lets out a triumphant laugh."
msgstr ""

#: sinclaire_sink/Martin_Stays_Martin/0/11
msgctxt "Sinclaire"
msgid "Vindication! Sweet vindication!"
msgstr ""

#: sinclaire_sink/Martin_Stays_Martin/0/22
msgctxt "Sinclaire"
msgid "All those naysayers have now been nay-said!"
msgstr ""

#: sinclaire_sink/Martin_Stays_Martin/0/30
msgctxt "Sinclaire"
msgid "Take that, Maggie! I could smell the doubt on you!"
msgstr ""

#: sinclaire_sink/Martin_Stays_Martin/0/41
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "I'm sorry, but I can't go along with this..."
msgstr ""

#: sinclaire_sink/Martin_Stays_Martin/0/52
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "I don't think this is where the evidence pointed us."
msgstr ""

#: sinclaire_sink/Martin_Stays_Martin/0/60/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "But you told me I could make the decision!"
msgstr ""

#: sinclaire_sink/Martin_Stays_Martin/0/61/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I think it's what's best for Martin."
msgstr ""

#: sinclaire_sink/Martin_Stays_Martin/0/62/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It doesn't matter - just listen to that guy. He's in pain!"
msgstr ""

#: sinclaire_sink/Martin_Stays_Martin/0/63/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Who cares? This is just kind of a goofy thing, right?"
msgstr ""

#: sinclaire_sink/Martin_Stays_Martin/0/c-1/11
msgctxt "Sinclaire"
msgid "...thank you."
msgstr ""

